# The repository root ignores lockfiles, which suits a plugin marketplace but
# not a deployed application: `npm ci` needs one, and without it a build in CI
# can silently resolve different dependency versions than a build here. Kept
# deliberately, and it is the only exception this app makes.
!package-lock.json
